   * @throws Exception thrown by {@link org.heigit.ohsome.ohsomeapi.inputprocessing.InputProcessor
   *         #processParameters() processParameters} and
   *         {@link org.heigit.ohsome.ohsomeapi.executor.ExecutionUtils
